 "text": "# Placeholders\n\nType: Bootstrap drop-in. Write standard Bootstrap 5.3.8 markup. The kit only changes the look; no new classes are needed.\nSection: Componentes\nHuman version (rendered examples): componentes/placeholders.html\nProse language: Brazilian Portuguese. Code, class names and identifier tables are language-neutral.\n\nEsqueletos de carregamento. Derivação mínima do kit.\n\n```\n<p class=\"placeholder-glow\">\n  <span class=\"placeholder col-7\"></span>\n  <span class=\"placeholder col-4\"></span>\n  <span class=\"placeholder col-6\"></span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"placeholder-wave\">\n  <span class=\"placeholder col-9\"></span>\n  <span class=\"placeholder col-5\"></span>\n</p>\n```\n\n## Em um card\n\n```\n<div class=\"card\" style=\"max-width:260px\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n  <div class=\"card-body\">\n    <h5 class=\"card-title placeholder-glow\"><span class=\"placeholder col-6\"></span></h5>\n    <p class=\"card-text placeholder-glow\">\n      <span class=\"placeholder col-7\"></span>\n      <span class=\"placeholder col-4\"></span>\n    </p>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-primary disabled placeholder col-4\" aria-disabled=\"true\"></a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n## Tamanhos\n\n```\n<p class=\"placeholder-glow\"><span class=\"placeholder placeholder-lg col-6\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"placeholder-glow\"><span class=\"placeholder col-6\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"placeholder-glow\"><span class=\"placeholder placeholder-sm col-6\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"placeholder-glow\"><span class=\"placeholder placeholder-xs col-6\"></span></p>\n```\n\n« Paginação · Popovers »\n",
